## 7. Authentication & RBAC (Revised)

### 7.1 Firebase → Backend Flow
```
Client (Web/Android) → Firebase.getIdToken() → Bearer <token>
         │
         ▼
  Auth Service: shared FastAPI dependency
         │
         ├── 1. Check Redis cache (TTL 5min) → HIT: return cached user
         │
         ├── 2. MISS: firebase_admin.auth().verify_id_token(token)
         │
         ├── 3. Fetch user from PostgreSQL by firebase_uid
         │
         └── 4. Cache in Redis → return AppUser { id, email, role, permissions[] }
```

### 7.2 Shared Auth Dependency (all services import this)
```python
# shared/auth/dependencies.py
async def get_current_user(token: str = Depends(oauth2_scheme)) -> AppUser:
    ...  # Redis cache → Firebase verify → PostgreSQL lookup

async def require_role(*roles: UserRole):
    def dependency(user = Depends(get_current_user)):
        if user.role not in roles:
            raise HTTPException(403)
    return dependency

# Usage in any service:
@router.post("/jobs")
async def create_job(user = Depends(require_role("EMPLOYER", "SUPER_ADMIN"))):
    ...
```

### 7.3 Employer Verification (All 3 Steps)
```
STEP 1 — Email Domain Check (automated, instant)
  Employer registers → extract domain from email
  Known company domain? (e.g. @tcs.com) → flag as "trusted_domain"
  Unknown domain? → proceed to Step 2

STEP 2 — Admin Manual Review (human in the loop)
  employer_verification record created → status: PENDING_REVIEW
  Admin sees notification in /admin/employers queue
  Admin can: APPROVE (with note) | REJECT (with reason)
  Kafka event → employer notified of decision via email

STEP 3 — Post-Approval Constraints
  APPROVED employers can post jobs (status: PENDING job approval)
  Job still goes through ADMIN job approval before going live
  REJECTED employers cannot post until re-verified

Combined States:
  employer.verification_status: 
    EMAIL_DOMAIN_TRUSTED → can post immediately
    PENDING_REVIEW       → cannot post, waiting admin
    APPROVED             → can post (jobs still need approval)
    REJECTED             → cannot post, reason shown
```

