welcome_candidate.html      → On CANDIDATE registration
welcome_employer.html       → On EMPLOYER registration
employer_verified.html      → When employer is approved/rejected
job_approved.html           → Employer: job is live
application_received.html   → Employer: new application
stage_update.html           → Candidate: stage changed
```

### Push Notifications (Firebase Cloud Messaging)
```
Works for: Android app + Web PWA
Events:
  New job match found       → "New job matching your skills: Senior Dev at TCS"
  Application stage update  → "Your application at Infosys moved to Interview 🎉"
  Employer replied          → "Infosys added a note to your application"

Android setup:
  POST /api/auth/fcm-token  → Register device FCM token
  Token stored in PostgreSQL user_fcm_tokens table
```

### In-App Notifications (WebSocket)
```
WebSocket endpoint: ws://api/notifications/ws?token=<firebase_token>
Real-time delivery while user is online
Falls back to FCM push if user is offline
```

